## 📊 Summary of Features & Architecture

| Component / Requirement | Implementation Details | Status |
| :--- | :--- | :---: |
| **UI Placement** | Dedicated **`📊 DAILY API KEY USAGE`** card with glassmorphism styling, compact progress bars, and status badges. | **PASSED** |
| **Persistence Engine** | Powered by browser `localStorage` under key `textline_usage_v1`. **Rebuilding or restarting `app.exe` never erases usage data.** | **PASSED** |
| **Generation Counting** | Increments count **only** when a key successfully generates the final answer (`status: 'success'`). Health checks & failed attempts are strictly excluded. | **PASSED** |
| **Event Deduplication** | Emits unique `generation_id` from backend. Duplicate events or reconnected listeners skip duplicate counting. | **PASSED** |
| **Configurable Limit** | Interactive `⚙️ Set Limit` button allows customizing daily limits per key / default (`DEFAULT_DAILY_LIMIT = 100`). | **PASSED** |
| **Remaining Calculation** | Dynamically calculates `max(daily_limit - used_today, 0)` labeled as **`Remaining (configured limit)`**. | **PASSED** |
| **Health State Sync** | Syncs latest health status (`WORKING`, `QUOTA`, `UNAUTHORIZED`, `BILLING`, `ERROR`) from API Key Health Monitor. | **PASSED** |
| **Last Used Indicator** | Displays `● LAST USED: HH:MM:SS` for the key that generated the most recent answer. | **PASSED** |
| **Historical Dates** | Date selector dropdown allows viewing today's usage as well as historical usage (`2026-08-14`, etc.). | **PASSED** |
| **Unit Tests** | **10/10 Tests Passed** in `test_fallback_system.py`. | **PASSED** |
| **Production Binary** | Compiled standalone executable at [dist/app.exe](file:///c:/github/textline/dist/app.exe). | **PASSED** |

